 data-language="plain">| **module** | VARCHAR(150) | not null | | |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| **ref_id** | VARCHAR(100) | not null | | |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| **status** | VARCHAR(100) | not null | | |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| **message** | TEXT | not null | | |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| **created_by** | VARCHAR(150) | not null | | |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| **created_at** | TIMESTAMP | not null, default: CURRENT_TIMESTAMP | | |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| **updated_at** | TIMESTAMP | not null, default: CURRENT_TIMESTAMP | | |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">#### Indexes</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| Name | Unique | Columns |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| ---------------------------------- | ------ | ---------- |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| idx_api_integration_log_app | | app |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| idx_api_integration_log_created_at | | created_at |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| idx_api_integration_log_module | | module |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| idx_api_integration_log_ref_id | | ref_id |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">| idx_api_integration_log_status | | status |</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">## Relationships</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">- **tces_settlement_header to tces_settlement_detail**: one_to_many</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">## Database Diagram</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">```mermaid</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">erDiagram</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">tces_settlement_header ||--o{ tces_settlement_detail : references</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">integration_payload {</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">BIGSERIAL id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(100) category</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(50) ref_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">JSON payload</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP created_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(150) created_by</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(100) status</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TEXT message</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP updated_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">JSONB response_from_tics</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">INTEGER email_sent</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP email_sent_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(500) file_path</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">JSONB email_error_response</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP email_failed_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">INTEGER email_attempt</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP email_last_attempt_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">INTEGER retry_count</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">tces_settlement_detail {</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">SERIAL id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">INTEGER settlement_header_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">UUID rq_uuid</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(50) tx_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(100) payment_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">NUMERIC(18,2) settlement_amount</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">DATE settlement_date</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(200) settlement_remark</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP created_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP updated_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(25) pol_nr</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(25) quo_nr</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(10) belnr</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(4) gjahr</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">tces_settlement_header {</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">SERIAL id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">UUID rq_uuid</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP rq_datetime</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(50) sender_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(50) receiver_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(100) password</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(50) comm_code</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">NUMERIC(18,2) settlement_fee</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(50) bank_ref</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(20) source_bank_code</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">NUMERIC(18,2) amount</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">INTEGER count_trx</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(100) signature</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">JSONB raw_json</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP created_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP updated_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">tces_espay_settlement_payment_details {</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">BIGINT id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">UUID rq_uuid</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) tx_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) payment_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">DECIMAL settlement_amount</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP settlement_date</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) settlement_remark</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) pol_nr</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) quo_nr</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) belnr</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIME gjahr</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP created_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) created_by</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">tces_espay_settlement_payment {</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">BIGINT id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">UUID rq_uuid</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP rq_datetime</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) comm_code</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">DECIMAL settlement_fee</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) bank_ref</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) source_bank_code</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">DECIMAL amount</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">INTEGER count_trx</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP created_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) created_by</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(255) payout_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">tces_espay_settlement_payment_logs {</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">BIGSERIAL id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(150) app</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(150) module</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(100) ref_id</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(100) status</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TEXT message</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">VARCHAR(150) created_by</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP created_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">TIMESTAMP updated_at</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">```</div></div><p><br></p><p>Kebutuhan informasi penambahan kolom</p><div class="ql-code-block-container" spellcheck="false"><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-- Tambah kolom</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">ALTER TABLE tces_settlement_detail</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS pol_number VARCHAR(25),</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS quo_number VARCHAR(25),</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS zsddt0002_docs JSONB DEFAULT ''{}''::jsonb;</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-- Dokumentasi deskripsi kolom</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">COMMENT ON COLUMN tces_settlement_detail.pol_number IS ''Nomor Polis'';</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">COMMENT ON COLUMN tces_settlement_detail.quo_number IS ''Nomor Quotation'';</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">COMMENT ON COLUMN tces_settlement_detail.zsddt0002_docs IS ''Data dokumen ZSDDT0002 dalam format JSONB'';</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain"><br></div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-- Skema rollback</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">ALTER TABLE tces_settlement_detail</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">DROP COLUMN IF EXISTS pol_number,</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">DROP COLUMN IF EXISTS quo_number,</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">DROP COLUMN IF EXISTS zsddt0002_docs;</div></div><p><br></p><p>Berikut untuk informasi bentukan table yang dibutuhkan oleh API Settlement Payment.</p><p><br></p><p><img src="/uploads/notes/syafix_said/20260922_100605_f567397e.png"></p>', 'Technical', '#ef4444', 0, '2026-09-22 10:07:30.4423441', '2026-09-22 10:09:43.6181657', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', 734, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (33, 'Informasi Tambahan Definisi Data ZSDDT0002', '<p>Ketika melakukan pendefinisian proses, di dapatkan informasi bahwa dalam 1 zreq_id terdapat beberapa BELNR dan GJAHR dengan kasus :</p><ol><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Berbeda-beda : artinya setiap data premi memiliki no doc akuntansi yang berbeda, yang mengartikan bahwa perbedaan itu dapat berarti (Co-Insurance / Re-Insurance / Insured), begitu juga dengan Tahun (GJAHR)</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Hanya satu : artinya setiap data di dalam zreq_id tersebut memiliki 1 doc id begitu juga dengan Tahun (GJAHR)</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Beberapa dan kosong : perlu di pastikan kembali premi mana saja yang masuk ke dalam 1 doc yang sama atau berbeda.</li></ol>', 'Task Note', '#ef4444', 0, '2026-09-22 10:13:33.6124023', '2026-09-22 10:13:33.6124029', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', 735, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (34, 'Update Diagram API Settlement Payment', '<p>berikut untuk tambahan update yang sudah final dari API Settlement Payment</p><p><br></p>', 'Task Note', '#6366f1', 0, '2026-09-24 04:16:30.2309543', '2026-09-24 04:16:30.2309551', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', 752, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (35, 'Import Postman Collection untuk API Settlement Payment', '<p>Berikut file yang digunakan untuk import collection API Settlement Payment ke postman </p>', 'General', '#ef4444', 0, '2026-09-24 04:17:38.1407455', '2026-09-24 04:17:38.1407461', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (36, 'Catatan Meeting Rekonsiliasi Settlement Paymen', '<p>Berikut untuk hasil MoM</p>', 'Task Note', '#6366f1', 0, '2026-09-28 15:31:20.7279169', '2026-09-28 15:32:11.7889662', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', 772, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (37, 'Table Design dan ERD untuk API Settlement Payment - Final', '<p>Table Design dan ERD untuk API Settlement Payment - Final</p><p><br></p>', 'Task Note', '#6366f1', 0, '2026-09-28 15:37:49.8035229', '2026-09-28 15:37:49.8035235', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', 771, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (38, 'Link QA Tracker API Settlement Payment', '<p>Link QA Tracker Settlement Payment </p><p><a href="https://elistec1-my.sharepoint.com/:x:/g/personal/syafix_said_elistec_com/IQCAjPGo_c1sRJlZsjmtI8BEAZgWIzwscBGDEBZih6ngtN0?e=alJ1RH" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">QA_Tracker_Settlement_API.xlsx</a></p>', 'Task Note', '#6366f1', 0, '2026-09-28 15:50:07.3604092', '2026-09-28 15:50:07.3604094', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', 755, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (39, 'Cara menjalankan enforce manual stagging', '<p>Langkah 1</p><p>Link API : <a href="https://api2.tugu.com/tics_staging_uat/swagger/index.html" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Swagger UI</a></p><p><br></p><div class="ql-code-block-container" spellcheck="false"><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">curl -X ''POST'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">''https://api2.tugu.com/tics_staging_uat/api/JobIns/PullDataTics'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-H ''accept: */*'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-H ''Content-Type: application/json-patch+json'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-d ''{</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"MANDT": 120,</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"ZREQ_ID": "202609251000001"</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}''</div></div><p><br></p><p>Langkah 2</p><p>Lakukan Extract SS</p><p><br></p><div class="ql-code-block-container" spellcheck="false"><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">curl -X ''POST'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">''https://api2.tugu.com/tics_staging_uat/api/Outbound/TransactionInsurance/Extract_SS'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-H ''accept: text/plain'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-H ''Content-Type: application/json-patch+json'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-d ''{</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"ZACTION": "C",</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"ZREQ_ID_TICS": "202609251000001",</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"ERROR_NO": ""</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}''</div></div><p><br></p><p>Langkah 3</p><p>Cek Response</p><p><br></p><div class="ql-code-block-container" spellcheck="false"><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">curl -X ''POST'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">''https://api2.tugu.com/tics_staging_uat/api/Outbound/TransactionInsurance/Response'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-H ''accept: */*'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-H ''Content-Type: application/json-patch+json'' \</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">-d ''{</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"MANDT": "120",</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"ZACTION": "Y",</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"ZREQ_ID": "202609251000001"</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}''</div></div><p><br></p><p>Langkah 4</p><p>Transaction Insured - Menggunakan ZREQ_ID STAGGING</p><div class="ql-code-block-container" spellcheck="false"><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">https://api2.tugu.com/tics_staging_uat/api/Outbound/TransactionInsurance/202609300000021</div></div><p><br></p><p>Langkah 5</p><p>Check Callback ke TICS - Menggunakan ZREQ_ID TICS</p><div class="ql-code-block-container" spellcheck="false"><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">https://api2.tugu.com/tics_staging_uat/api/Outbound/TransactionInsurance/Response/TICS</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">{</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"MANDT": "120",</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"ZACTION": "C",</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">"ZREQ_ID": "202609301000004"</div><div class="ql-code-block" data-language="plain">}</div></div>', 'Technical', '#ef4444', 0, '2026-09-29 03:31:00.0979269', '2026-10-08 12:47:51.7460099', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (40, 'Update finalisasi validasi payload API Settlement Payment', '<p>Berikut untuk update finalisasi validasi payload API Settlement Payment :</p><p><br></p><div class="ql-code-block-container" spellcheck="false"><div class="ql-code-block"> return [</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''rq_uuid''                  =&gt; ''required|string'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''rq_datetime''              =&gt; [''required'', ''string'', ''date_format:Y-m-d H:i:s''],</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''sender_id''                =&gt; ''required|string'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''receiver_id''              =&gt; ''required|string'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''password''                 =&gt; ''required|string'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''comm_code''                =&gt; ''required|string'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''settlement_fee''           =&gt; [''required'', ''string'', ''numeric'', ''gte:0'', ''regex:/^[0-9]+\.[0-9]{2}$/''],</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''bank_ref''                 =&gt; ''required|string'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''source_bank_code''         =&gt; ''nullable'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''amount''                   =&gt; [''required'', ''string'', ''numeric'', ''gte:0'', ''regex:/^[0-9]+\.[0-9]{2}$/''],</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''count_trx''                =&gt; [''required'', ''string'', ''numeric''],</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''signature''                =&gt; ''required|string'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''data''                     =&gt; ''required|array|min:1'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''data.*.tx_id''             =&gt; [''required'', ''string'', ''distinct''],</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''data.*.payment_id''        =&gt; ''required|string'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''data.*.settlement_amount'' =&gt; [''required'', ''string'', ''numeric'', ''gte:0'', ''regex:/^[0-9]+\.[0-9]{2}$/''],</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''data.*.settlement_date''   =&gt; [''required'', ''string'', ''date_format:Y-m-d''],</div><div class="ql-code-block">            ''data.*.settlement_remark'' =&gt; ''nullable|string'',</div><div class="ql-code-block">        ];</div></div>', 'General', '#ef4444', 0, '2026-09-29 06:37:44.7171767', '2026-09-29 06:37:44.7171789', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (41, 'API Payload Settlement Payment Fix', '<p><br></p><div class="ql-code-block-container" spellcheck="false"><div class="ql-code-block">{</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "rq_uuid": "17c3c81d-9dce-478f-b549-10cdc5a1303c",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "rq_datetime": "2025-10-30 10:50:04",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "sender_id": "SGOPLUS",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "receiver_id": "SGWTUGUINSURANCE",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "password": "TSPZFRJQ",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "comm_code": "SGWTUGUINSURANCE",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "settlement_fee": "5550.00",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "bank_ref": "29",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "source_bank_code": null,</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "amount": "82565.00",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "count_trx": "1",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "signature": "00572abf757a97e1e87d5fead24aba5989510297",</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "data": [</div><div class="ql-code-block">    {</div><div class="ql-code-block">      "tx_id": "ESP1761670926L9GL",</div><div class="ql-code-block">      "payment_id": "ORD20260930180417-9006",</div><div class="ql-code-block">      "settlement_amount": "82565.00",</div><div class="ql-code-block">      "settlement_date": "2025-10-30",</div><div class="ql-code-block">      "settlement_remark": "SGWTU2910291025S92"</div><div class="ql-code-block">    }],</div><div class="ql-code-block">  "our_ref_nbr": "ORD20260930180417-9077"</div><div class="ql-code-block">}</div><div class="ql-code-block"><br></div></div>', 'General', '#6366f1', 0, '2026-10-01 01:41:54.2441399', '2026-10-01 01:41:54.2441612', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (42, 'Meeting Pembahasan Integrasi BengkelNet dengan TCES dan Tics', '<p>Berikut untuk file MoM hasil meeting dengan tim BengkelNet</p>', 'Meeting', '#6366f1', 0, '2026-10-07 02:05:08.5905804', '2026-10-08 12:53:59.0834022', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', 797, 1);
INSERT INTO "Notes" ("Id", "Title", "ContentHtml", "Category", "Color", "IsPinned", "CreatedAt", "UpdatedAt", "AuthorUserId", "TaskId", "CompanyId") VALUES (43, 'Catatan Staging Cloud', '<ol><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Mekanisme Retry message broker (15s, 60s, 300s) setelah melewati itu maka pesan akan dimasukkan ke DLQ dan tidak akan pernah di retry</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Mekanisme Circuit Breaker, state akan berpindah menjadi OPEN Ketika ada error(500,502,503,504, ECONNREFUSED, ETIMEDOUT, ENOTFOUNDECONNRESET)</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Ketika state menjadi CLOSED dia akan menghitung cooldown selama 60s sebelum dia mengirim probe-request yang akan menjadikan state nya menjadi HALF-OPEN, setelah pengiriman request pertama dan hasilnya server masih error maka state akan Kembali ke OPEN dan menghitung cooldown lagi selama 60s</li></ol>', 'General', '#ef4444', 0, '2026-10-09 09:37:04.084841', '2026-10-09 09:37:04.0848941', '77474c1c-f8fc-4c0c-8028-0e37424b85bc', NULL, 1);
